<view class="page"><view class="title">营业与接单</view><view class="subtitle">时间按上海时间，单店默认同时服务 1 人。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view class="card"><view class="label">开始营业</view><picker mode="time" value="{{opens}}" data-field="opens" bindchange="timeChange">{{opens}}</picker><view class="label">结束营业</view><picker mode="time" value="{{closes}}" data-field="closes" bindchange="timeChange">{{closes}}</picker><view class="label">每日休息开始</view><picker mode="time" value="{{breakStart}}" data-field="breakStart" bindchange="timeChange">{{breakStart}}</picker><view class="label">每日休息结束</view><picker mode="time" value="{{breakEnd}}" data-field="breakEnd" bindchange="timeChange">{{breakEnd}}</picker><view class="label">同时容量（1–5）</view><input class="field" type="number" value="{{capacity}}" data-field="capacity" bindinput="input"/><view class="row"><view>暂停接受新预约</view><switch checked="{{paused}}" bindchange="toggle" color="#385b4e"/></view><view class="label">演示专属等级履约门槛（元）</view><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{threshold}}" data-field="threshold" bindinput="input"/><view class="rule">TODO（待定稿）：升级计入时点尚未确定。这里只演示“已履约实付价值”，不构成正式会员承诺。修改不重算历史卡权益及历史累计值。</view><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy||!ready}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存并检查已有预约</button></view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="rule">{{message}}</view><view wx:for="{{preserved}}" wx:key="id" class="card">保留：{{item.timeText}} · {{item.customer_name}} · {{item.statusText}}</view></view>
